1
00:00:00,228 --> 00:00:02,243
Your business might be this frog

2
00:00:02,394 --> 00:00:04,190
The old fable goes like this

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,408
Drop a frog into boiling water

4
00:00:06,428 --> 00:00:07,830
and it jumps straight out

5
00:00:07,939 --> 00:00:09,641
But put it in cool water and heat

6
00:00:09,661 --> 00:00:11,764
it slowly and it stays

7
00:00:11,784 --> 00:00:12,483
Calm

8
00:00:12,503 --> 00:00:13,297
Comfortable

9
00:00:13,317 --> 00:00:14,613
Until it's too late

10
00:00:14,939 --> 00:00:16,806
That's the boiling frog effect

11
00:00:16,826 --> 00:00:19,342
Real frogs biologists say would jump

12
00:00:19,362 --> 00:00:20,776
Companies often don't

13
00:00:20,983 --> 00:00:24,335
In business danger rarely arrives as a crisis

14
00:00:24,355 --> 00:00:26,618
It arrives as one percent a month

15
00:00:26,983 --> 00:00:31,114
Kodak built the first digital camera in 1975

16
00:00:31,134 --> 00:00:34,375
In 2012 Kodak filed for bankruptcy

17
00:00:34,571 --> 00:00:37,758
In 2000 Blockbuster passed on buying Netflix for fifty

18
00:00:37,778 --> 00:00:39,020
million dollars

19
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:42,530
In 2010 Blockbuster filed for bankruptcy

20
00:00:42,716 --> 00:00:43,663
Right now

21
00:00:43,683 --> 00:00:46,705
AI is warming the water in every industry

22
00:00:46,725 --> 00:00:47,644
Quietly

23
00:00:47,861 --> 00:00:49,339
So set your jump line now

24
00:00:49,359 --> 00:00:51,296
Pick the number that makes you move before

25
00:00:51,316 --> 00:00:52,801
the water feels hot

26
00:00:54,528 --> 00:00:56,178
Don't wait to feel the heat
